### Register a user
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/register/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "aswin",
    "email": "aswin@example.com",
    "password": "mypassword123"
}

### Login
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/login/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "aswin",
    "password": "mypassword123"
}

### Create Task
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/tasks/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token fe7ed08bd136af82792a064668ea6dcbced34c33

{
    "title": "CREATE A TURF MANAGEMENT API",
    "description": "Complete TURF API",
    "due_date": "2026-11-30",
    "status": "in progress"
}

### List My Tasks
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/tasks/
Authorization: Token fe7ed08bd136af82792a064668ea6dcbced34c33

### Get Single Task
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/tasks/1/
Authorization: Token fe7ed08bd136af82792a064668ea6dcbced34c33


### Update Task
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/tasks/1/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Token fe7ed08bd136af82792a064668ea6dcbced34c33


{
    "title": "completed python assignment",
    "description": "python drf assignment is completed",
    "due_date": "2026-11-28",
    "status": "completed"
}

### Delete Task
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/tasks/2/
Authorization: Token fe7ed08bd136af82792a064668ea6dcbced34c33
